{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53916","headline":"送崔铉赴淮南 · 宣宗皇帝李忱","name":"送崔铉赴淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今遣股肱亲养治，一方狱市获来苏。\n（《金华子杂编》卷上）（按：《全唐诗》卷四收此诗，前一句完全不同，故重录。\n此承陶先生告知。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝李忱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}